          MDM UART MONITOR - PURCHASE AGREEMENT
==========================================================================

Please read this agreement carefully before purchasing MDM UART Monitor.

By purchasing and using this software, you acknowledge and agree to the following terms:

1. PURPOSE OF THE SOFTWARE

MDM UART Monitor is a professional UART Log Monitoring and Analysis Tool 
designed to help mobile repair technicians read, monitor, save, search, and analyze UART boot logs.

This software is an assistant for technicians and is NOT an automatic mobile repair solution.

---------------------------------------------------------

2. TECHNICAL KNOWLEDGE REQUIRED

This software is intended for users who have basic knowledge of:

• Mobile Repairing
• UART Boot Logs
• Hardware Diagnostics
• Boot Sequence Analysis

Without sufficient technical knowledge, the information displayed by the software 
may not be properly understood or interpreted.

---------------------------------------------------------

3. NO AUTOMATIC FAULT DETECTION

MDM UART Monitor DOES NOT automatically detect or identify every hardware or software fault.

The software displays UART logs and may help technicians identify possible issues such as:

• Boot sequence failures
• PMIC / Power initialization problems
• Memory (eMMC/UFS) related errors
• Bootloader failures
• Security or authentication errors
• Communication and protocol errors
• Other diagnostic information available through UART logs

However, not every mobile fault produces a UART log, and many hardware problems 
cannot be diagnosed using UART alone.

---------------------------------------------------------

4. NO GUARANTEE OF REPAIR

Purchasing this software does NOT guarantee that every mobile phone can be diagnosed or repaired.

Successful diagnosis depends on several factors including:

• Device model
• Boot stage
• UART output availability
• Hardware condition
• Technician's experience
• Correct interpretation of UART logs

---------------------------------------------------------

5. USER RESPONSIBILITY

The user is solely responsible for analyzing UART logs and making repair decisions.

MDM TECHNOLOGY is not responsible for any incorrect diagnosis, repair failure, 
financial loss, or damage resulting from the interpretation or misuse of UART log data.

---------------------------------------------------------

6. SOFTWARE CAPABILITIES

This software is designed to:

✔ Read UART Logs
✔ Display UART Logs
✔ Save Logs
✔ Search Logs
✔ Assist in Technical Analysis

This software is NOT designed to:

✘ Automatically repair devices
✘ Automatically identify every hardware fault
✘ Replace professional repair knowledge
✘ Guarantee successful repairs

---------------------------------------------------------

7. PURCHASE POLICY

Please purchase this software only if you clearly understand its purpose and limitations.

Purchasing this software means you are buying a professional UART log analysis tool—
not an automatic mobile fault detection or repair solution.

---------------------------------------------------------

8. REFUND POLICY

Due to the digital nature of this software, NO refund or cancellation will be provided after activation or delivery.

Refund requests based on expectations beyond the advertised features will not be accepted.

---------------------------------------------------------

9. ACCEPTANCE

By purchasing, activating, or using MDM UART Monitor, you confirm that:

✔ You have read this agreement.
✔ You understand the purpose and limitations of the software.
✔ You agree to all the terms mentioned above.

==========================================================================
                MDM TECHNOLOGY
        Professional Mobile Repair Solutions
==========================================================================
